置默认值","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"296b55cb15c05209d943311772b8051c945881bad01c403418a077736ce08c4e"},"DMFG Defaults":{"translation":"DMFG 默认设置","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"1aeb657a3480f5a49b9105b63928fbd1b77291a3edb50c63491d9390ede98bce"},"Global Dynamic Multi Frame Generation defaults. Set these once — then just enable Dynamic mode on each game's MFG dialog.":{"translation":"全局动态多帧生成（DMFG）默认设置。设置一次后，只需在各游戏的 MFG 对话框中启用“动态”模式即可。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"429dd910fc53dda0a3eacf798fd3dbe40739ec0535723312e98c35c29e7b6a24"},"Frame Count":{"translation":"帧数","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"b6925c2b9f42022b6c1f30215f5f5aa71e519a87cd42e02d852421315c66b810"},"Global DMFG max frame count. Games using Dynamic mode inherit this unless overridden per-game.":{"translation":"全局 DMFG 最大帧数。使用动态模式的游戏会继承此值，除非单独覆盖。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"c6841e55644fb4758525e6b3e38cd06d1024440d1b351d96a08ad2444367a5be"},"Target FPS":{"translation":"目标 FPS","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"b22a096dcccd743ce0c494699ecc510bf035a51b0345a0e95f8524dd2b10521f"},"Global DMFG target frame rate. Off = no target. Max Refresh Rate = match display. Or pick a specific FPS.":{"translation":"全局 DMFG 目标帧率。关 = 不设目标；最大刷新率 = 匹配显示器；也可选择指定 FPS。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"5bed25f6f80e6d688442e33009765e9ad9172956a7589bc9016c7843ee2845f4"},"Batch Deploy":{"translation":"批量部署","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"8e2043fa89c292549fcc1cc2fd0e09571fd85b906343151b47449593d27cf02c"},"Deploy DLSS and Streamline DLL versions and DLSS presets to multiple games at once. Backs up originals automatically. Pre-populated with your configured defaults.":{"translation":"一次向多个游戏部署 DLSS、Streamline DLL 版本和 DLSS 预设。会自动备份原文件，并预先填入你配置的默认值。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"5228b37a062ed358947b625241ed7c40837d3fd7da1e98077639c49f89d7a5f6"},"DLSS On-Screen Indicator":{"translation":"DLSS 屏幕指示器","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"eecef5cd55d716b6d00a0c0614aa222ab665c965459e048960135bdb150dbcc4"},"Controls the 